tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯上线AI应用生成平台“吐司”，支持自然语言一键打包生成安卓App</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI面向ChatGPT Pro用户推出个人理财工具，通过Plaid连接1.2万家金融机构</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI芯片厂商Cerebras成功上市，IPO筹资55亿美元市值达600亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌I/O大会将发布Gemini新模型与Android XR智能眼镜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0b6e43fdf05ccef5bf912a32e23d7c3b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年谷歌开发者大会将于5月19日至20日举行，谷歌预计发布新一代Gemini模型及代号“Jinju”的Android XR智能眼镜。新一代Gemini模型在Gemini 3.1 Pro基础上进行轻量化升级，性能对标GPT-5.5，重点优化端侧运行效率与上下文处理能力，旨在实现中低端安卓机型的流畅AI体验。同期亮相的智能体平台“Gemini Spark”将支持跨应用任务处理。硬件方面，谷歌联合三星与Gentle Monster研发基于Android XR系统的无屏AI眼镜。此外，Android 17 Beta版或将开放Gemini Nano端侧能力，全新轻量化系统Aluminum OS有望首秀，推动Gemini从独立App向系统底层“Gemini Core”演进。在Alphabet 2026财年资本支出提升</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云发布AI设计智能体Ardot，支持一句话生成设计稿并一键转代码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/caed673002c8d3c1014b146b15a3560e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云正式发布自研AI设计智能体平台Ardot并开启公开测试，旨在打通产品、设计与研发全链路。该平台核心功能支持通过自然语言指令一句话生成可编辑的App页面、官网、海报及PPT等设计稿。为满足企业级规范，Ardot支持调用团队业务组件库，确保生成内容符合视觉标准。在兼容性方面，平台支持导入Figma文件并保留完整布局与组件数据。研发协同上，Ardot实现“设计一键转代码”，设计数据可直接导入CodeBuddy或Cursor等IDE进行还原。此外，平台支持多人实时评论、标注反馈及版本对比，微信小程序版本也已进入上线准备阶段。Ardot通过整合设计与开发工作流，显著降低了产设研协作门槛，提升了跨端协同效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯上线AI应用生成平台“吐司”，支持自然语言一键打包生成安卓App</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d61aa52b9c76af4f2057cf7fcdbd3c75.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于5月15日正式上线AI应用生成及灵感共创平台“吐司”，该产品定位为内部孵化的vibe coding工具。用户仅需通过自然语言描述需求，AI即可自动拆解功能、生成原型并一键打包为APK安装包。吐司1.0版本核心功能包括：应用创造、社交分享、灵感广场及应用搜索。用户可将创作的应用发布至广场，支持他人一键复刻或进行二次创意接力，构建“想法-应用-分发-共创”的生态闭环。目前，吐司安卓版已在应用宝及官网首发，iOS版本后续推出。该平台旨在降低开发门槛，让无代码基础用户实现灵感落地。公测期间产品采取限时免费策略，后续将通过分享任务等形式提供使用次数。此举标志着腾讯正式入局AI应用生成赛道，通过强化共创属性，加速推动AI原生应用的普及与分发。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI面向ChatGPT Pro用户推出个人理财工具，通过Plaid连接1.2万家金融机构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日正式面向美国地区ChatGPT Pro用户预览推出个人理财工具（Personal Finance Tools）。该工具通过集成Plaid API，支持用户连接Schwab、Fidelity、Chase等超1.2万家金融机构，实现银行卡、券商及信用卡数据的一键同步。用户可通过对话查询消费趋势、资产表现及订阅支出，并进行财务规划。该功能深度依赖GPT-5.5的上下文推理能力，并结合了此前收购的Hiro团队在金融合规方面的经验。为保障高敏感数据安全，OpenAI采取了数据隔离与最小化原则，支持用户随时断开连接并彻底清除财务记忆。此举标志着OpenAI正式切入个人金融决策赛道，将AI能力从通用对话延伸至垂直专业场景。目前该功能仅限网页端与iOS端，后续将根据反馈逐步向Plus用户开放。行业分析认为，此举</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI芯片厂商Cerebras成功上市，IPO筹资55亿美元市值达600亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa7d464ff0bb21f829b46e0fa3f51c2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI芯片制造公司Cerebras Systems正式完成IPO，此次募资总额达55亿美元，上市后市值迅速飙升至约600亿美元。Cerebras成立于2016年，曾于2019年面临破产危机，其核心技术突破在于打破传统微处理器架构，成功研发出将整个硅片集成为单一超大规模AI芯片的方案，并攻克了复杂的封装、供电及散热难题。目前，Cerebras已与OpenAI达成深度合作，不仅成为其重要客户，还获得了10亿美元贷款支持。作为合作协议的一部分，Cerebras将限制向特定竞争对手销售产品，以优先保障OpenAI的算力需求。创始人安德鲁·费尔德曼表示，公司未来将聚焦特定客户合作，持续优化AI计算性能。此次上市标志着Cerebras从濒临破产的初创企业正式转型为半导体行业的重要算力供应商。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
